      "hizbQuarter": 16,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 252,
      "text": "Who is it that will lend to Allah a goodly loan[136], so He will multiply it for him manifold? It is Allah Who withholds and gives in abundance, and to Him you will be returned.",
